      "source": "Interface for the cluster commands supported by Redis. A <a href=\"RedisClusterNode.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisClusterNode</code></a> can be obtained from\n<a href=\"#clusterGetNodes()\"><code>clusterGetNodes()</code></a> or it can be constructed using either <a href=\"RedisNode.html#getHost()\"><code>host</code></a> and\n<a href=\"RedisNode.html#getPort()\"><code>RedisNode.getPort()</code></a> or the <a href=\"RedisNode.html#getId()\"><code>node Id</code></a>.",
      "translation": "这是 Redis 支持的集群命令的接口。可以通过 <a href=\"RedisClusterNode.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisClusterNode</code></a> 获取节点信息，该节点可通过 <a href=\"#clusterGetNodes()\"><code>clusterGetNodes()</code></a> 方法获得，也可以利用 <a href=\"RedisNode.html#getHost()\"><code>host</code></a> 和 <a href=\"RedisNode.html#getPort()\"><code>RedisNode.getPort()</code></a> 或 <a href=\"RedisNode.html#getId()\"><code>node Id</code></a> 来构造。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
